Package: pobecu
Type: Package
Title: Population of Ecuador by Province, Canton and Parish (Población del
    Ecuador por Provincia, Cantón y Parroquia)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ronald Fabricio", "Salas Guerrero",
           email = "fabriciosalasguerrero@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides the official population estimates and projections of
    Ecuador published by the National Institute of Statistics and Censuses
    (INEC, "Instituto Nacional de Estadística y Censos"), Revision 2024:
    national (1950-2050), provincial (1990-2035) and cantonal (2010-2035)
    figures by sex, age and urban/rural area, identified by the codes of the
    political-administrative division (DPA, "División
    Político-Administrativa") <https://www.ecuadorencifras.gob.ec/proyecciones-poblacionales/>.
    Because INEC does not publish projections for parishes, the package also
    offers a parish-level estimate for 2010-2035 that distributes the official
    cantonal projection among parishes using their shares in the 2010 and 2022
    censuses (logistic extrapolation) and their age and sex structure in the
    2022 census (iterative proportional fitting); parish figures always add up
    to the official cantonal ones. Includes helpers to aggregate ages, join
    population denominators to case tables and compute rates. Documentation
    is in Spanish.
